  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4f6e8993ed68f1c47b5bcfa27204605d, type: 3}
  m_Name: ultimaHard
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSystem.DialogueData
  lines:
  - <size=115%><b>Hey!</b></size>
  - You're getting really close now.
  - Just a few more rooms and this will all be over.
  - And...
  - I heard there's a reward waiting for you at the end.
  - <color=#FFB6C1><size=135%><b>A CAKE!</b></size></color>
  - <color=#FFB6C1><b>A really good one, too.</b></color>
  - ... <color=#AAAAAA><size=80%><i>Probably.</i></size></color> ...
  - <color=#AAAAAA><size=80%><i>I mean, that's what I was told.</i></size></color>
  - Anyway!
  - <size=110%><b>Keep going!</b></size>
  - You've come <i>way</i> too far to stop now.
